# CR 702.177b's example: Elvish Refueler allows an action only while its controller "haven't begun to activate an exhaust
# ability this turn". Turn 3: Loot, the Pathfinder (haste) uses its exhaust mana ability (RRR) and the Refueler its exhaust, each
# for the first time. Turn 5: the Refueler's exhaust is activated again as though it had not been, and while its {1}{G} is
# being paid Loot's exhaust mana ability, used before, is refused: an exhaust ability has begun to be activated this turn. The
# Moxen pay instead (4/5). Turn 7: Loot's mana ability is the first exhaust ability of that turn, so it is offered again
# (RRR), and once it has been activated the Refueler's own exhaust is refused: a mana ability counts as an exhaust ability
# activated this turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Elvish Refueler
Forest
Loot, the Pathfinder
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Refueler.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Loot, the Pathfinder.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Loot, the Pathfinder.Activate(Ability: Add three mana; Color: Red)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}{R}
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Refueler.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Refueler.Power = 3
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Refueler.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Loot, the Pathfinder.Activate(Ability: Add three mana)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Refueler.Power = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Refueler.Toughness = 5
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Loot, the Pathfinder.Activate(Ability: Add three mana; Color: Red)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Refueler.Activate

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}{R}
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Refueler.Power = 4
